  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to UNSCAR 2022-23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Trust Facility Supporting Cooperation on Arms Regulation (UNSCAR) is a multi-donor flexible funding mechanism designed to fund projects aimed at supporting the implementation of the Arms Trade Treaty (ATT) and the United Nations Programme of Action on small arms and light weapons (UNPoA). To this effect, the Facility: mobilises resources to support the ratification and implementation of the ATT and the implementation of the PoA; improves effectiveness of assistance through better coordination, monitoring and matching of resources; promotes increased sustainability through more predictable sources of funding.</narrative>
  </description>
